A Taddhita affix added to a word to show that something
 is completely changed into the thing expressed by that word, or that it
 is left at the complete disposal or control of that thing; {#BasmasAt#}
 {#BU#} ‘to be completely reduced to ashes’; {#agnisAt kftvA#} <ls>M. 5</ls>; {#BasmasAt#}
 {#kftavataH pitfdvizaH pAtrasAYca vasuDAM sasAgarAm#} <ls>R. 11. 86</ls>; {#viBajya#}
